# Dossier portraits. Every card is a render of a game model: the vanilla half
# of Bohemia's CWA bodies, the "lobo" half of @LoBo's. Both are game data, and
# this repo keeps game data out of git on purpose, for the same reason the
# @LoBo repairs ship as a rerunnable script and the CI island fixture was
# authored GPL-clean rather than borrowed. The tracked artifacts are the
# regeneration path and the catalogue metadata, never the imagery:
#   tools/screenshots/portraits/portrait_{vanilla,lobo}.test.{sqf,toml}
#   tools/screenshots/portrait_process.py
#   guerrilla-mode/core/portraits/{README.md,catalogue.json}
# A clone with no portraits is a supported state: every dossier falls back to
# the "Photograph unavailable" panel and both portrait suites skip.
/guerrilla-mode/core/portraits/*.paa
/deploy/creds.txt
/deploy/**/values-prod.yaml
/deploy/**/values.prod.yml
/deploy/infra/charts/
*.zip

